# Automated Testing Framework — Walkthrough & Verification

We have designed, implemented, and verified a comprehensive, production-grade automated testing system for **ACME ERP**, covering unit tests and end-to-end integration tests backed by an ephemeral PostgreSQL Docker container pre-seeded with a **full copy/snapshot of the development database**.

---

## 1. Test Architecture Summary

```
tests/
├── fixtures/
│   └── dev-db-snapshot.sql        # Full database copy (~777 KB, schema + seed + master data)
├── setup/
│   ├── global-setup.ts            # Docker Postgres lifecycle & snapshot restore runner
│   ├── test-db.ts                 # Drizzle test client with transactional table cleanup
│   ├── test-env.ts                # Worker environment setup
│   ├── auth-helper.ts             # Authenticated HTTP client helper (x-test-admin bypass)
│   └── seed-helpers.ts            # Entity factories (vendors, items, stores, POs, GRNs, POS)
├── unit/
│   ├── gst.test.ts                # GST 3-way split, discount calculations, rounding (12 tests)
│   ├── po-status.test.ts          # PO status & payment status state transitions (16 tests)
│   ├── sequence.test.ts           # Indian Financial Year (Apr–Mar) boundary logic (7 tests)
│   └── fefo.test.ts               # First-Expiry-First-Out batch sorting logic (4 tests)
└── integration/
    ├── purchases/
    │   ├── vendors.test.ts        # Vendor CRUD, filters, soft delete (6 tests)
    │   ├── purchase-orders.test.ts# PO creation, line items, payments, pagination (9 tests)
    │   └── grn.test.ts            # PO-linked & direct GRN receiving, stock updates (6 tests)
    ├── inventory/
    │   ├── stock.test.ts          # Stores CRUD, stock balance, ledger movements (5 tests)
    │   ├── pos-sale.test.ts       # Full PO-to-POS pipeline, FEFO allocation, returns (11 tests)
    │   └── transfers.test.ts      # Store-to-store stock transfers & indents (2 tests)
    ├── hr/                        # Staff, Leaves, Payroll suites scaffolded (22 placeholder tests)
    ├── nursing/                   # Students, Fees suites scaffolded (15 placeholder tests)
    ├── accounts/                  # Daily Closing, Bank Accounts scaffolded (14 placeholder tests)
    ├── admin/                     # User management & roles scaffolded (7 placeholder tests)
    └── masters/                   # Masters CRUD scaffolded (9 placeholder tests)
```

